<title>USA: Monterey Pasta sees &quot;substantial&quot; Q3 loss.</title>
<headline>Monterey Pasta sees &quot;substantial&quot; Q3 loss.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monterey Pasta Co said late Friday that it would report a &quot;substantial&quot; third-quarter loss that would exceed its earlier expectations.</p>
<p>The company mades the announcement after the close of regular Nasdaq trading.</p>
<p>Last year, Monterey Pasta reported a loss of $1.89 a share for the third quarter.</p>
<p>The company said it has appointed BDO Seidman LLP as its auditors and is consulting with them regarding the third quarter results.</p>
</text>
